        "text": "DATA STORES (L4)\n\nScenario IR (structured scenario description)\n.xosc / .xodr files (generated artifacts)\nValidation results (errors, warnings, dry-run logs)\nSimulation runs (state snapshots, OSI ground truth)\nMetrics & evaluation results (TTC, collision, lane departure, safety scores)\nLogs (execution logs, error traces)\nScenario metadata (IDs, versions, parameter sets, seeds, map/sim versions)\nFeedback history (repair actions, regeneration attempts, ranking decisions)",
        "font": "mono",
